 "sections": [
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000403",
   "key": "lead",
   "section_type": "lead",
   "heading": null,
   "level": 2,
   "position": 0.0,
   "visibility": "public",
   "canon": "approved",
   "version": 1,
   "word_count": 23,
   "generated": false,
   "in_world": true,
   "author_canon": false,
   "source_ref": null,
   "body_md": "Aldo was lord of [[lampton]] and the father of [[cato]] and [[dana]]. The [[testmark-chronicle|Testmark Chronicle]] remembers him as the victor of the [[battle-at-the-ford|Ford]].",
   "html": "<p>Aldo was lord of <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/lampton\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000031\" data-slug=\"lampton\">Lampton</a> and the father of <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/cato\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000022\" data-slug=\"cato\">Cato</a> and <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/dana\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000024\" data-slug=\"dana\">Dana</a>. The <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/testmark-chronicle\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000050\" data-slug=\"testmark-chronicle\">Testmark Chronicle</a> remembers him as the victor of the <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/battle-at-the-ford\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000040\" data-slug=\"battle-at-the-ford\">Ford</a>.</p>\n"
  },
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000404",
   "key": "history",
   "section_type": "history",
   "heading": "History",
   "level": 2,
   "position": 10.0,
   "visibility": "public",
   "canon": "approved",
   "version": 1,
   "word_count": 27,
   "generated": false,
   "in_world": true,
   "author_canon": false,
   "source_ref": null,
   "body_md": "Aldo married [[gilda]] in YV 1020; she died four years later. In YV 1025 he married [[bera]]. He ruled from [[lampton]] until his death in YV 1060.",
   "html": "<p>Aldo married <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/gilda\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000026\" data-slug=\"gilda\">Gilda</a> in YV 1020; she died four years later. In YV 1025 he married <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/bera\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000021\" data-slug=\"bera\">Bera</a>. He ruled from <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/lampton\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000031\" data-slug=\"lampton\">Lampton</a> until his death in YV 1060.</p>\n"
  },
  {
   "id": "00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000405",
   "key": "secret-history",
   "section_type": "secret_history",
   "heading": "Secret history",
   "level": 2,
   "position": 60.0,
   "visibility": "designer",
   "canon": "approved",
   "version": 1,
   "word_count": 28,
   "generated": false,
   "in_world": true,
   "author_canon": false,
   "source_ref": null,
   "body_md": "Aldo knew that Cato was not his son and raised him as his own. He let the chronicle give him Dirk's victory as the price of his silence.",
   "html": "<p>Aldo knew that Cato was not his son and raised him as his own. He let the chronicle give him Dirk's victory as the price of his silence.</p>\n"
  },
